msgid "Social Relay for Postiz"
msgstr "Social Relay for Postiz"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: social-relay-for-postiz.php:4
msgid "https://github.com/dcarrero/social-relay-for-postiz"
msgstr "https://github.com/dcarrero/social-relay-for-postiz"

#. Description of the plugin
#: social-relay-for-postiz.php:5
msgid "Auto-publish and schedule your WordPress content on social networks through your own Postiz instance (self-hosted or Postiz Cloud)."
msgstr "Publica y programa automáticamente tu contenido de WordPress en redes sociales a través de tu propia instancia de Postiz (autoalojada o Postiz Cloud)."

#. Author of the plugin
#: social-relay-for-postiz.php:9
msgid "Color Vivo"
msgstr "Color Vivo"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: social-relay-for-postiz.php:10
msgid "https://colorvivo.com"
msgstr "https://colorvivo.com"

#: social-relay-for-postiz.php:31
msgid "Social Relay for Postiz requires PHP 8.2 or higher."
msgstr "Social Relay for Postiz necesita PHP 8.2 o superior."

#: social-relay-for-postiz.php:43
msgid "Social Relay for Postiz is missing its dependencies. Run \"composer install\" or install a release build."
msgstr "A Social Relay for Postiz le faltan dependencias. Ejecuta \"composer install\" o instala una versión publicada."

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:54
msgid "Social media"
msgstr "Redes sociales"

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:55
msgid "Publishing and scheduling content on social networks."
msgstr "Publicación y programación de contenido en redes sociales."

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:73
msgid "WordPress post ID."
msgstr "ID de la entrada de WordPress."

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:87
msgid "Get Postiz connection status"
msgstr "Ver el estado de la conexión con Postiz"

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:88
msgid "Returns whether the site is connected to Postiz, the instance URL, the detected API path and where the API key comes from. Never returns the key."
msgstr "Indica si el sitio está conectado a Postiz, la URL de la instancia, la ruta de API detectada y de dónde sale la clave de API. Nunca devuelve la clave."

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:107
msgid "List social channels"
msgstr "Listar los canales sociales"

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:108
msgid "Lists the social network channels connected in Postiz (id, name, network identifier, disabled)."
msgstr "Lista los canales de redes sociales conectados en Postiz (id, nombre, identificador de la red, desactivado)."

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:129
msgid "Preview social posts"
msgstr "Previsualizar las publicaciones sociales"

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:130
msgid "Shows the message each channel would receive for a post (templates, UTM and limits applied) without sending anything."
msgstr "Muestra el mensaje que recibiría cada canal para una entrada (con plantillas, UTM y límites aplicados) sin enviar nada."

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:140
msgid "Share a post on social networks"
msgstr "Compartir una entrada en redes sociales"

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:141
msgid "Queues a published post to be sent to Postiz with its publishing profile. Use preview-post first to check the messages."
msgstr "Pone en cola una entrada publicada para enviarla a Postiz con su perfil de publicación. Usa antes preview-post para revisar los mensajes."

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:150
msgid "Send even if the same content was already sent."
msgstr "Enviar aunque ya se haya enviado el mismo contenido."

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:170
msgid "Get social sharing status of a post"
msgstr "Ver el estado de los envíos de una entrada"

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:171
msgid "Lists what was sent to Postiz for a post: channel, status (queued, published, error, draft, cancelled), publish date, published URL and error."
msgstr "Lista lo enviado a Postiz para una entrada: canal, estado (en cola, publicada, error, borrador, cancelada), fecha de publicación, URL publicada y error."

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:181
msgid "Cancel pending social posts"
msgstr "Cancelar las publicaciones sociales pendientes"

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:182
msgid "Deletes in Postiz the drafts and future scheduled posts of a WordPress post. Posts already published on the networks are not touched."
msgstr "Borra en Postiz los borradores y las publicaciones programadas a futuro de una entrada de WordPress. No toca lo que ya está publicado en las redes."

#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesRegistration.php:262
msgid "Only published posts can be shared."
msgstr "Solo se pueden compartir entradas publicadas."

